From 018822ea765d0d46f802a31b66195c8b06443056 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Review <review@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:46:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Harden custom discovery providers and scheduled discovery

- Add shared ProviderHeaderPolicy (save-time and send-time), including API key header
- Reject obviously internal endpoint hosts when saving providers
- Block 6to4/Teredo/NAT64/documentation IPv6 ranges in address policy
- Add 60s total budget for custom providers per search
- De-duplicate candidates per batch, truncate titles, tolerate concurrent inserts
- Scheduler: keep partial results on Brave 429, space queries, handle SqlException
- Add endpoint, header policy and address policy tests; update AS_BUILT
